  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Avian Influenza Control and Human Pandemic Preparedness and Response Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective is to minimize the threat posed to humans by Highly Pathogenic Avian Influenza (HPAI) infection and other zoonoses and to prepare for, control, and respond to influenza pandemics and other infectious disease emergencies in humans.   The Board approved the revised PDO on October 15, 2009.</narrative>
  </description>
